“It’s not for you.” “Who’s it for, then?”
“Well… it’s for me” Noticing that his eyes were starting to narrow, she added, “If I look pretty, then maybe you’ll do nice things for me.” She felt like she was digging herself into a deeper and deeper hole, but she wasn’t going to give up.
