The look of suspicion then left his eyes. The warm afternoon sunlight shone on his grinning face.

That arrogant devil has no idea that he’s stepping into my trap, she thought. She smiled back at him, thinking, Make the smile pretty for him, Layla. Even though you hate him… no, because you hate him… make it pretty.


